      "file": "src/types/user.ts",
      "description": "### Step 68/95. Type user.ts (State & Schema Layer)\n\n#### 💡 Architectural Purpose & Why It Exists\nDefines TypeScript types, validation rules, and context providers for strict type-safe state distribution.\n\n#### 🔍 Beginner's Code Breakdown\n1. Type Schemas: Strongly types document structures and action objects\n2. Context API: Supplies global state to nested trees without props drilling\n3. Runtime Validation: Enforces schema correctness using Zod or custom type guards\n\n#### 🔄 Data Flow Relay\n- **Inbound from**: dashboard-modals.tsx, dashboard-overview.tsx, quest-card.tsx, time-capsule-card.tsx, use-dashboard-actions.ts, use-dashboard-groups.ts, use-dashboard-habit-pace.ts, use-dashboard-invitations.ts, use-dashboard-notifications.ts, use-dashboard-sync.ts, use-dashboard-warnings.ts, donate.tsx, chat-context.ts, group-chat-provider.tsx, group-chat.tsx, use-group-actions.ts, use-report-system.ts, use-chat-data-engine.ts, use-chat-sync-controller.ts, use-group-messages.ts, use-cheer-system.ts, use-chat-visual-effects.ts, use-unity-score.ts, invite-modal.tsx, members-modal.tsx, unity-modal.tsx, use-group-options.ts, use-letter-box.ts, letter-box.tsx, mascot.tsx, use-my-notes.ts, use-note-actions.ts, use-recap.ts, my-notes.tsx, note-detail-modal.tsx, use-note-submission.ts, new-note.tsx, profile.tsx, time-capsule-modal.tsx, use-user-profile-data.ts, user-profile-modal.tsx, welcome-story-modal.tsx, auth-context.ts, auth-provider.tsx, use-letter-availability.ts, use-time-capsule.ts, group-utils.ts\n- **Outbound to**: None (Terminal Leaf)\n\n#### 💡 Pro Tip: Best Practices\nCentralizing type definitions ensures TypeScript immediately flags every file needing updates when data schemas change.\n\n---\n\n### Step 68/95. Type user.ts (状態 & スキーマ層)\n\n#### 💡 アーキテクチャ上の設計意図（なぜこの層にこのファイルが必要？）\nアプリ全体でやり取りされるデータの型（TypeScriptインターフェース）やバリデーション規則を定義し、型安全な状態配信を担います。\n\n#### 🔍 初心者向けコードの読み解きポイント（主要関数と仕組み）\n1. スキーマ & 型定義: ドキュメント構造やアクション型の厳格な型付け\n2. Context API: 状態をアプリ全体へバケツリレーなしで届けるプロバイダー\n3. 入力バリデーション: Zod や型ガードによる実行時データの検証\n\n#### 🔄 データの流れ（データリレー）\n- **⬅️ 入力元**: dashboard-modals.tsx, dashboard-overview.tsx, quest-card.tsx, time-capsule-card.tsx, use-dashboard-actions.ts, use-dashboard-groups.ts, use-dashboard-habit-pace.ts, use-dashboard-invitations.ts, use-dashboard-notifications.ts, use-dashboard-sync.ts, use-dashboard-warnings.ts, donate.tsx, chat-context.ts, group-chat-provider.tsx, group-chat.tsx, use-group-actions.ts, use-report-system.ts, use-chat-data-engine.ts, use-chat-sync-controller.ts, use-group-messages.ts, use-cheer-system.ts, use-chat-visual-effects.ts, use-unity-score.ts, invite-modal.tsx, members-modal.tsx, unity-modal.tsx, use-group-options.ts, use-letter-box.ts, letter-box.tsx, mascot.tsx, use-my-notes.ts, use-note-actions.ts, use-recap.ts, my-notes.tsx, note-detail-modal.tsx, use-note-submission.ts, new-note.tsx, profile.tsx, time-capsule-modal.tsx, use-user-profile-data.ts, user-profile-modal.tsx, welcome-story-modal.tsx, auth-context.ts, auth-provider.tsx, use-letter-availability.ts, use-time-capsule.ts, group-utils.ts\n- **➡️ 送信先**: なし (終端 / 末端モジュール)\n\n#### 💡 プロの知恵・なぜこう書くのか？\n型定義を中央集権化（types/）しておくことで、データベースの仕様変更があった際も TypeScript が修正箇所をすべて教えてくれます。",
